    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>5级 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 野兽（鳞爪类）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 63；''重伤'' 31</span><span>''先攻'' +6</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 19，''强韧'' 19，''反射'' 17，''意志'' 16</span><span>''侦查'' +3</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}啮咬✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+10 vs. AC<br>命中：2d8+2 伤害，且该角龙兽快步 2 格。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}角抵✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+11 vs. AC<br>命中：3d8+2 伤害，且目标倒地。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">包围移动✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>触发：当一个邻接该角龙兽的敌人被近战攻击命中时。<br>该角龙兽快步 2 格。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 18（+6）</span><span>''敏捷'' 14（+4）</span><span>''感知'' 12（+3）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 15（+4）</span><span>''智力'' 2（-2）</span><span>''魅力'' 8（+1）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span></div></div>\n</div>",
